"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4166111219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118013#issuecomment-4166111219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118013","id":4166111219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74Uc_z","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T22:44:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T22:45:11Z","body":"> I do wonder why ram usage can't be reported in release mode, I feel that could be beneficial in release builds for normal users when they provide feedback as it could be put into the details and point towards a possible memory leak which has been missed during development and testing with the debug builds.\r\n\r\nThe memory usage counters are disabled in non-debug builds to reduce bookkeeping, as it has a performance impact:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4a919adccf8e398aceca75399c539078c54fe97f/core/os/memory.cpp#L64-L67\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4a919adccf8e398aceca75399c539078c54fe97f/core/os/memory.cpp#L226-L240\r\n\r\nEnabling them in release builds (possibly based on a opt-in project setting) should be discussed in a proposal.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4166111219/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]